  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Make bubble a normal tab as fallback on iOS 18.\n            - Rename AddGesture to AddNativeGesture for clarifictation.\n            - Prevent pull-to-refresh when RefreshCommand cannot execute.\n            - Preserve system colors when using Color.WithAlpha.\n            - Put transparent under Colors namespace.\n            - Add parameters to gesture, submit, refresh, load-more and tab commands.\n            - Support local ImageSource icons across controls, menus, toolbars, tabs and map pins.\n            - Redesign bindings with fluent directions, converters, update triggers and observable nested paths.\n            - Add managed factory creation for NativeViews.\n            - Inject haptics service into DI/ContentView instead of static utility.\n            - Move Navigator, Sharer, SystemPicker and Haptics services from ContentView to View.",
